  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><div class=\"bg-off-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-8 pt-8 lg:mb-16 breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/de/questions\">Häufige Frage</a><i class=\"icon\">chevron_right</i><a href=\"/de/question_categories/buying\">Einkaufen</a><i class=\"icon\">chevron_right</i><span>How can I see the reserve for an auction?</span></div><div class=\"lg:flex gap-16 mb-16\"><div class=\"lg:w-3/4\"><h1 class=\"font-serif text-5xl mb-8\">How can I see the reserve for an auction?</h1><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-8 auction-body\"><p>All reserve prices are hidden, so as not to affect bidding. You can see in an auction whether the reserve price has been reached or not, but we will not show any information beyond that. All bidding on Bidders Highway is by maximum bid so that you do not have to pay more than you have to. If your maximum bid is lower than the reserve price, you will place your maximum bid; if your maximum bid is higher than the reserve price, the bid will stop at the exact reserve price.</p></div></div><div class=\"lg:w-1/4 mt-8 lg:mt-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-6\">Kategorien</h2><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 lg:block\"><li><a href=\"/de/questions\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Alle</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/buying\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent px-2 border-black! text-black! hover:text-black!\">Einkaufen</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/selling\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Verkaufen</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/bidding\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Bieten</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/documentation\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Dokumentation</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/account\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Konto</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/payment\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Zahlungen</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/shipping\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Transport</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/verification\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Verifizierung</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 pb-16\"><div class=\"w-full p-8 bg-amber-100 rounded sm:flex justify-between items-center\"><div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl sm:text-4xl mb-4\">Weitere Fragen?</h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base mb-2 sm:mb-8\">Sie können uns eine E-Mail senden. Wir helfen Ihnen gerne weiter!</p><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"font-bold underline hover:text-neutral-800\">support@biddershighway.com</a></div><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"hidden sm:block\"><img src=\"/assets/contact-us-4411369c.svg\" alt=\"Contact us\" class=\"w-48 h-36\"></a></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center py-8\"><a href=\"/de\" class=\"inline-block rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors px-4 py-2 text-white bg-jaffa hover:bg-zest disabled:bg-yellow-700 disabled:text-neutral-300 px-6 py-3\">Alle unsere Autoauktionen ansehen</a></div></div></main>",
